35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard devices are a mess. The 2021 trial failed because of spreadsheets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The invoices show separate licenses climbing yearly. Bundled ones stayed flat.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Last winter's outage was unowned for two days. Support is scattered.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The 2018 data lift had mismatched codes for a year. The dispatch tool is old.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,Two admins retire this year. The last hiring took eleven months.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, does the bundled option cover our yard needs?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, I need to see the vendor details to compare the bundles.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the dispatch tool history suggests we avoid complex upgrades.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, exactly. We need something that doesn't age quietly.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the depot calendar is tight. We have no freeze window in winter.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The peak season cutover is risky. We need a system that fits our calendar.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The board minutes show capital requests are trimmed, but operating lines pass easily.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The warehouse rules changed twice last year. The scope never survived a year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. We can't afford that again.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The depot supervisors dropped the new routines quickly. Training is key.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
